@startuml SQ-06
title SQ-06 Spectator transition & spectator join [P]
participant "Eliminated Client" as E
participant "Room Spectator Client" as S
participant "Match Server" as MS
participant "Backend API" as B
== Eliminated competitor becomes spectator (FR-058, FR-222) ==
MS -> MS : peerRole[E] = SPECTATOR
MS -> E : S2C_RoleChanged {SPECTATOR}
E -> E : switch to spectator camera; hide joystick/skill
E -> MS : C2S_ControlInput / C2S_SkillActivate (stale or malicious)
MS -> MS : drop: role != COMPETITOR; increment counter (FR-090, SEC-015)
== Spectator joining mid-match (TBD OQ-GP-07) ==
S -> B : POST /v1/matches/{matchId}/tickets {role: SPECTATOR}
B -> B : check room membership, spectator capacity [TBD]
B -> B : INSERT match_server_command TicketGrant
B --> S : 200 {host, udpPort, ticket}
MS -> B : heartbeat (<= 1 s later)
B --> MS : {commands: [TicketGrant]}
S -> MS : connect + C2S_Hello {ticket}
MS --> S : S2C_Welcome {role: SPECTATOR} + full snapshot
@enduml
